@startuml 5g-packet-common
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title 5G Core: общая схема PDU Session, QoS Flow и policy

actor "UE" as UE
rectangle "gNB" as GNB
node "5G Core SBA" as CORE {
  rectangle "AMF\nregistration, access,\nN2 anchor" as AMF
  rectangle "SMF\nPDU Session,\nQoS control" as SMF
  rectangle "UPF\nN3/N6 user plane,\nQoS enforcement" as UPF
  database "UDM\nsubscription" as UDM
  database "PCF\npolicy control" as PCF
  database "CHF\ncharging" as CHF
  rectangle "AF / NEF\napplication policy exposure" as AF
}
cloud "Data Network\nDNN: internet/ims/enterprise/mec" as DN

UE --> GNB : QoS Flows / DRB
GNB --> AMF : N2
GNB --> UPF : N3 GTP-U
AMF --> SMF : N11
SMF --> UPF : N4\nPDR/FAR/QER/URR
SMF <--> PCF : N7\nsession policy
PCF <--> AF : N5/N33\napp requests
SMF --> UDM : N10\nsubscription
SMF --> CHF : N40\ncharging
UPF --> DN : N6
SMF --> GNB : QoS profile\n5QI, ARP, GFBR, MFBR

note right of SMF
SMF связывает policy и forwarding:
создает PDU Session, QoS rules for UE,
N2 QoS to gNB, N4 rules to UPF.
end note
@enduml
